 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Light for «الوسيلة», geometric for «عزيز حكيم». 36-37 (the Fire): night sky, no gold for «ما في الأرض جميعا», nothing literal. The theft penalty: no hand drawn, no people; 38:3-4 shows only that it is carried out by those in authority. «وجاهدوا» not illustrated. STAGING v4: 35: believers pray in a prayer hall for seeking nearness to Allah by obedience (prayer is among the acts As-Sa'di lists): standing on 35:6, bowing on 35:8 with the light plate, rising, prostrating on 35:12, sitting on 35:13. Nothing is drawn for striving (35:9): no weapon, no fighting. 36-37 (the Fire, no ransom) stay ambient: the unseen. 38 (the penalty for theft) stays ambient with no people and no hand; its mood is now geometric (a ruling of Allah) instead of rays of light over a penalty. The cover is the geometric plate on 38:12, so no worshippers sit under a title about theft."
 },
